  "title": "RTX's Pratt & Whitney Canada signs PW127M maintenance agreement with Emerald Airlines",
  "summary": "Comprehensive engine support will strengthen Emerald Airlines' regional operations through 2030 LONDON, July 21, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Farnborough International Airshow -- Pratt & Whitney Canada has signed a nearly five-year contract with Emerald Airlines to provide comprehensive maintenance, repair and overhaul (MRO) services for PW127M engines powering ATR 72-600 regional turboprops. Pratt & Whitney is an RTX (NYSE: RTX) business.",
